sometimes we have an app that need a large number of objects,
these objects take a significant amount of memory.
imagine we have google map on mobile!

the App need to load so many points to rendering map!
thousands cafes, restaurant, hospital,...

in this App we have:
Point class (have x,y of place,
             name of the place,
             icon of the place)

PointService class that call backend to get points from server
it's like when we open the app, he will load all points!


Problem: we are loading thousands points from server on small mobile
         so many mobile crashed because they had not enough memory!
         we can use flyweight pattern to solve this problem!